// Each row is the surface an OpenBMC build for this board serves, keyed by version alone, because
// bmcweb's compiled resource set is a property of the image. The 3.22.00 row was MEASURED on both
// fleet hosts simultaneously on 2026-08-12 by authenticated BMC SSH and loopback Redfish, which
// makes it a catalog row rather than a per-host note — srv3 (192.168.1.192) and srv4
// (192.168.1.195), independently flashed on different days, returned legacy Chassis Thermal 200,
// ThermalSubsystem 404, ThermalSubsystem/Fans 404, a 9-member Sensors collection, and a
// byte-identical Thermal key shape (12974 and 12975 bytes, differing only in a reading value). Two
// independently-arrived-at hosts agreeing on every axis is what shows the shape is a function of
// the image; one host would only establish what that host does. The 2.07.00 row is the historical
// pre-upgrade snapshot for srv3, retained because the catalog must still answer for an un-upgraded
// host, not because any fleet member currently runs it.

